  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "This notable compilation was brought to Poland by BobMark (later Ages), which was also responsible for distributing the Pegasus console on the Polish market. BobMark teamed up with Taiwanese company Realtec (BIC) and British publisher and game developer Codemaster to create a high-end and quality product, while significantly improving their existing brand of published games.\r\n\r\nThis notable compilation included such titles as Big Nose Freaks Out, Ultimate Stuntman, Micro Machines. Big Nose The Caveman and The Fantastic Adventures of Dizzy. Each of these titles was original in its own way, unique and stood out strongly from other games available for the Pegasus console. So let me present to you all the greatness that the Golden Five hides in store."
    }
  ],
